==English==

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|en|en|thrall}}.

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|enthral}} ''(chiefly UK)''

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[hold]] [[spellbound]]; to [[bewitch]], [[charm]] or [[captivate]].
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To make [[subservient]]; to [[enslave]] or [[subjugate]].

====Synonyms====
* (''hold spellbound''): [[bewitch]], [[captivate]], [[charm]], hold in [[awe]], [[transfix]]
* (''make subservient''): [[enslave]], [[subjugate]]

